# Brisbane Parking Finder — no secrets required for local development.
#
# Place BCC CSVs under data/ (see data/README.md), then:
#   make ingest && make api
#
# Optional future overrides (not read by the current Python server;
# ports are fixed at 8080 API / 5173 Vite unless you change the code):
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# PORT=8080
